Description: Portuguese Citizen Card middleware and application (unofficial build)
 Unofficial, independently built and modified version of the Portuguese
 Citizen Card (Cartao de Cidadao) middleware, derived from the source code
 published by AMA - Agencia para a Modernizacao Administrativa, I.P.
 (https://github.com/amagovpt/autenticacao.gov) under the EUPL v1.2.
 .
 It provides a utility application (eidguiV2), a set of libraries and a
 PKCS#11 module to read the card, authenticate and sign documents.
 .
 This package is not produced, endorsed or supported by AMA.
